{
    "groupId": "9128",
    "total_dialogue_lines": 88,
    "speaker_counts": {
        "Player": 33,
        "Varka": 55
    },
    "talks": [
        {
            "talkId": "6912801",
            "initDialog": "691280101",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "691280101",
                    "speaker": "Varka",
                    "text": "Well met, Honorary Knight!"
                },
                {
                    "id": "691280102",
                    "speaker": "Varka",
                    "text": "Seems to me you've got quite the stronghold yourself."
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "talkId": "6912802",
            "initDialog": "691280201",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "691280201",
                    "speaker": "Player",
                    "text": "How do you like it here?"
                },
                {
                    "id": "691280202",
                    "speaker": "Varka",
                    "text": "Couldn't be more at home! a true Knight of Boreas can build his den anywhere.",
                    "choices": [
                        {
                            "id": "691280203",
                            "text": "Boreas...",
                            "response": [
                                {
                                    "id": "691280205",
                                    "speaker": "Varka",
                                    "text": "Animals adapt to their environment to survive. I've got personal experience in that regard — both after and during the expedition.",
                                    "choices": [
                                        {
                                            "id": "691280206",
                                            "text": "Before the expedition?",
                                            "response": [
                                                {
                                                    "id": "691280207",
                                                    "speaker": "Varka",
                                                    "text": "Some animals conceal themselves to avoid predators, often hiding in inhospitable terrain."
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "691280208",
                                                    "speaker": "Varka",
                                                    "text": "Thorny bushes, perilous cliffs... the spires of the Favonius Cathedral, the rooftop of a certain knightly headquarters..."
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "691280209",
                                                    "speaker": "Player",
                                                    "text": "Um, those last two don't seem quite right..."
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "691280210",
                                                    "speaker": "Varka",
                                                    "text": "Haha, those were my hiding spots after escaping the office! The others gradually got quite good at finding me, though."
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "691280211",
                                                    "speaker": "Varka",
                                                    "text": "These days... I'd probably have to hide behind the wind barriers in Stormterror's Lair, or Dragonspine's peak during a blizzard...",
                                                    "choices": [
                                                        {
                                                            "id": "691280212",
                                                            "text": "Maybe you could just stay here...",
                                                            "response": [
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "691280214",
                                                                    "speaker": "Varka",
                                                                    "text": "Thanks, but I'd rather do without. Sleeping more soundly would lower my alertness and ability to make a quick getaway."
                                                                }
                                                            ]
                                                        },
                                                        {
                                                            "id": "691280213",
                                                            "text": "I can make you another pillow if you need one."
                                                        }
                                                    ]
                                                }
                                            ]
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "id": "691280215",
                                            "text": "During the expedition?",
                                            "response": [
                                                {
                                                    "id": "691280216",
                                                    "speaker": "Varka",
                                                    "text": "Yup. It took us through lots of desolate, dangerous terrain — we often had to make camp in hostile surroundings."
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "691280217",
                                                    "speaker": "Varka",
                                                    "text": "We took cots and tents, of course, but there were some nights when we had no time to set them up."
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "691280218",
                                                    "speaker": "Player",
                                                    "text": "Didn't you have your own special tent?"
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "691280219",
                                                    "speaker": "Varka",
                                                    "text": "I did, but when my troops were freezing, I could hardly sleep soundly in comfort, could I? I always let the wounded use my tent instead."
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "691280220",
                                                    "speaker": "Varka",
                                                    "text": "*sigh* If only we had a teapot like this..."
                                                }
                                            ]
                                        }
                                    ]
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "691280204",
                            "text": "You make yourself sound like a wild animal..."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "talkId": "6912803",
            "initDialog": "691280301",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "691280301",
                    "speaker": "Player",
                    "text": "Would you like to chat?"
                },
                {
                    "id": "691280302",
                    "speaker": "Varka",
                    "text": "Chat? Sure, I'm quite the talker!"
                },
                {
                    "id": "691280303",
                    "speaker": "Varka",
                    "text": "..."
                },
                {
                    "id": "691280304",
                    "speaker": "Player",
                    "text": "...Why so silent?"
                },
                {
                    "id": "691280305",
                    "speaker": "Varka",
                    "text": "...I'm waiting for the drinks. Wait... Do you not have any?"
                },
                {
                    "id": "691280306",
                    "speaker": "Player",
                    "text": "None at all..."
                },
                {
                    "id": "691280307",
                    "speaker": "Varka",
                    "text": "Chatting without drinks... Haha, so that's how you do it...",
                    "choices": [
                        {
                            "id": "691280308",
                            "text": "You look a little lost.",
                            "response": [
                                {
                                    "id": "691280310",
                                    "speaker": "Varka",
                                    "text": "I'm fine. As an experienced Knight of Favonius, I can quickly adjust to even the most unusual of situations..."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "691280311",
                                    "speaker": "Varka",
                                    "text": "My expectations were a little... misaligned. Alright, let's go! Let's get this \"conference\" on the roaad.",
                                    "choices": [
                                        {
                                            "id": "691280312",
                                            "text": "Um... conference?",
                                            "response": [
                                                {
                                                    "id": "691280314",
                                                    "speaker": "Varka",
                                                    "text": "Every conversation without drinks is a \"conference.\""
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "691280315",
                                                    "speaker": "Varka",
                                                    "text": "I think my last one was probably when I had tea with the lovely ladies of the Hexenzirkel... Oh, actually, I may have attended a few during the expedition...",
                                                    "choices": [
                                                        {
                                                            "id": "691280316",
                                                            "text": "Well then, since you brought it up...",
                                                            "response": [
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "691280318",
                                                                    "speaker": "Varka",
                                                                    "text": "Ha, great question. First, find something you have in common, or bring up people or things they care about. For example..."
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "691280319",
                                                                    "speaker": "Varka",
                                                                    "text": "\"Oh my, your child is adorable! A real handful, you say? Haha, well, that's just how kids are — never a moment's peace. Take my two for example...\""
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "691280320",
                                                                    "speaker": "Varka",
                                                                    "text": "\"Looking for somewhere to settle in Teyvat? Well, it simply has to be Mondstadt! And just let me tell you why...\""
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "691280321",
                                                                    "speaker": "Varka",
                                                                    "text": "Then, once the conversation gets going, look for a new opening..."
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "691280322",
                                                                    "speaker": "Varka",
                                                                    "text": "\"Since the young 'uns are in Mondstadt, why don't you join us too?\""
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "691280323",
                                                                    "speaker": "Varka",
                                                                    "text": "\"Oh, I don't mean sign up to the Knights of Favonius. Let me think... would 'external support' be the right term?\""
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "691280324",
                                                                    "speaker": "Varka",
                                                                    "text": "Then, while they're still uncertain, go all in to assuage their concerns — and seal the deal!"
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "691280325",
                                                                    "speaker": "Varka",
                                                                    "text": "\"Don't worry! All sorts of people call Mondstadt home. I suppose you've heard that even Lupus Boreas was once a wanderer from a faraway land!\""
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "691280326",
                                                                    "speaker": "Varka",
                                                                    "text": "\"You don't need to do anything! We can handle most situations ourselves, and if we do need your help... I believe it'll be in everyone's interests.\""
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "691280327",
                                                                    "speaker": "Player",
                                                                    "text": "You've got quite the silver tongue."
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "691280328",
                                                                    "speaker": "Varka",
                                                                    "text": "Haha, thanks! In return for your kind words, let me treat you to a drink!"
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "691280329",
                                                                    "speaker": "Player",
                                                                    "text": "So you still want a proper \"conversation\"!"
                                                                }
                                                            ]
                                                        },
                                                        {
                                                            "id": "691280317",
                                                            "text": "How did you break the ice with the Hexenzirkel?"
                                                        }
                                                    ]
                                                }
                                            ]
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "id": "691280313",
                                            "text": "That sounds a bit formal..."
                                        }
                                    ]
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "691280309",
                            "text": "Aren't you usually an avid talker?"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "talkId": "6912804",
            "initDialog": "691280401",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "691280401",
                    "speaker": "Player",
                    "text": "Anything you'd like to do?"
                },
                {
                    "id": "691280402",
                    "speaker": "Varka",
                    "text": "Hmm... I was hoping to get my hands on the sand table I left behind at our Nod-Krai stronghold.",
                    "choices": [
                        {
                            "id": "691280403",
                            "text": "Still at work on your tactics even here?",
                            "response": [
                                {
                                    "id": "691280405",
                                    "speaker": "Varka",
                                    "text": "Haha... That sand table was indeed brought along to perform serious tactical simulations."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "691280406",
                                    "speaker": "Varka",
                                    "text": "That said, I would lend my fellow knights said table when I wasn't using it so they could conduct mock training. Gotta hone their strategic acumen and all."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "691280407",
                                    "speaker": "Varka",
                                    "text": "Some of them happened to be big \"Liyue Millennial\" fans, so they brought out their own cherished chess pieces to mark friend and foe. Really heightened the immersion.",
                                    "choices": [
                                        {
                                            "id": "691280408",
                                            "text": "\"Liyue Millennial\"...",
                                            "response": [
                                                {
                                                    "id": "691280410",
                                                    "speaker": "Varka",
                                                    "text": "Later, they decided that mock training shouldn't be limited to just fighting — they wanted to include enemy motives, detailed scenarios, elements of exploration and investigation — oh, and negotiation..."
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "691280411",
                                                    "speaker": "Varka",
                                                    "text": "Then another knight suggested we take notes from Fontaine's \"Tabletop Troupe\" — they wound up created a brand-new game using that template and designing quite a few battle scenarios."
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "691280412",
                                                    "speaker": "Varka",
                                                    "text": "The best maps, the best pieces, the best campaigns... You can probably guess what the result was.",
                                                    "choices": [
                                                        {
                                                            "id": "691280413",
                                                            "text": "With such thorough planning...",
                                                            "response": [
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "691280415",
                                                                    "speaker": "Varka",
                                                                    "text": "Ha! Imagination is an important prerequisite for combat adaptability. If you can have fun while honing your skills, that'd net you the best of both worlds.",
                                                                    "choices": [
                                                                        {
                                                                            "id": "691280416",
                                                                            "text": "So tell me...",
                                                                            "response": [
                                                                                {
                                                                                    "id": "691280418",
                                                                                    "speaker": "Varka",
                                                                                    "text": "Well..."
                                                                                },
                                                                                {
                                                                                    "id": "691280419",
                                                                                    "speaker": "Player",
                                                                                    "text": "Just as I thought."
                                                                                },
                                                                                {
                                                                                    "id": "691280420",
                                                                                    "speaker": "Varka",
                                                                                    "text": "Ahem... It's more than just a game, though. I've come up with a ton of useful battle plans by playing it!"
                                                                                },
                                                                                {
                                                                                    "id": "691280421",
                                                                                    "speaker": "Varka",
                                                                                    "text": "Besides, the knights need someone to host their campaigns! Someone who understands battlefield intricacies, someone who's adaptable, someone who has the gift of the gab..."
                                                                                },
                                                                                {
                                                                                    "id": "691280422",
                                                                                    "speaker": "Player",
                                                                                    "text": "You mean you're the Game Master!?"
                                                                                },
                                                                                {
                                                                                    "id": "691280423",
                                                                                    "speaker": "Varka",
                                                                                    "text": "Haha! It might sound like a drunkard's tongue twister, having the \"Grand Master\" as your \"Game Master,\" but why not?"
                                                                                },
                                                                                {
                                                                                    "id": "691280424",
                                                                                    "speaker": "Varka",
                                                                                    "text": "The next time we get together for a game, you should join us, Honorary Knight!"
                                                                                },
                                                                                {
                                                                                    "id": "691280425",
                                                                                    "speaker": "Varka",
                                                                                    "text": "Come to think of it, this stronghold of yours... It would make quite the upmarket sand table!"
                                                                                },
                                                                                {
                                                                                    "id": "691280426",
                                                                                    "speaker": "Varka",
                                                                                    "text": "Maybe we could have everyone play as a chess piece themselves, engage in some combat... Hang on, that just sounds like real military training... Hard to say if it'd be more fun or just plain exhausting..."
                                                                                }
                                                                            ]
                                                                        },
                                                                        {
                                                                            "id": "691280417",
                                                                            "text": "Did you get hooked too?"
                                                                        }
                                                                    ]
                                                                }
                                                            ]
                                                        },
                                                        {
                                                            "id": "691280414",
                                                            "text": "I'd probably want to play too."
                                                        }
                                                    ]
                                                }
                                            ]
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "id": "691280409",
                                            "text": "That astronomically expensive chess game?"
                                        }
                                    ]
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "691280404",
                            "text": "That's not your style!"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "talkId": "6912805",
            "initDialog": "691280501",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "691280501",
                    "speaker": "Player",
                    "text": "Good morning, Varka."
                },
                {
                    "id": "691280502",
                    "speaker": "Varka",
                    "text": "Morning, Honorary Knight."
                },
                {
                    "id": "691280503",
                    "speaker": "Varka",
                    "text": "There's a pleasant breeze today. May it carry you gently on your journey."
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "talkId": "6912806",
            "initDialog": "691280601",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "691280601",
                    "speaker": "Player",
                    "text": "Good night, Varka."
                },
                {
                    "id": "691280602",
                    "speaker": "Varka",
                    "text": "Hmm, you get some rest. As for myself... the night's still young!"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "talkId": "6912810",
            "initDialog": "691281001",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "691281001",
                    "speaker": "Varka",
                    "text": "Walking around a place like this gives me the feeling I'm about to turn a corner and run straight into The Flagship."
                },
                {
                    "id": "691281002",
                    "speaker": "Varka",
                    "text": "I tried no shortage of local libations while we were out on expedition. Drinks from Liyue, Natlan... But if we're talking about spirits, it's hard to look past Snezhnayan Fire-Water!"
                },
                {
                    "id": "691281003",
                    "speaker": "Varka",
                    "text": "However, all those miles and all that drinking only made me realize how much I miss the taste of home. There's something unforgettable about Mondstadt wine!"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "talkId": "6912811",
            "initDialog": "691281101",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "691281101",
                    "speaker": "Varka",
                    "text": "Ha, not a bad place to repair my weapons. Turns out two swords require twice the maintenance."
                },
                {
                    "id": "691281102",
                    "speaker": "Varka",
                    "text": "Weapons are the claws that the Knights of Boreas use to rend the flesh of their enemies, but they are also the hearts that hold our faith."
                },
                {
                    "id": "691281103",
                    "speaker": "Varka",
                    "text": "The weapons of knights of yore often become legends, every bit as well-known as their owners... Tell me, what stories do you think will be told of my blades one day?"
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}